，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"330ea1db86ec429a","term":"나르다","zh":"搬，搬运","audio":"/audio/330ea1db86ec429a16f7.mp3","entryId":"28302","definition":"把东西移到别处。","pronunciation":["나르다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4892d431135ffbaa4ee9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.587,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28302","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":83,"sequenceScore":2.3123,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我开车把书送到你们家吧。","这么多书要怎么带回家呢？","坐在这里休息一会儿，等惊慌的情绪平复下来吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这么多书要怎么带回家呢？","坐在这里休息一会儿，等惊慌的情绪平复下来吧。","我开车把书送到你们家吧。"],"answer":2}]}
